# Grafana Cloud — stack: davidjarrett001
# Portal: https://grafana.com/orgs/davidjarrett001
# Dashboard: https://davidjarrett001.grafana.net/d/sport-test-automator/...
#
# Get values: Cloud Portal → Stacks → davidjarrett001 → Prometheus → Details
# Never commit real tokens. Do not paste tokens into chat.
#
# Secret                          | Expected format                                      | Common mistake
# GRAFANA_CLOUD_REMOTE_WRITE_URL  | https://prometheus-prod-XX-....grafana.net/api/prom/push | Missing /api/prom/push
# GRAFANA_CLOUD_METRICS_INSTANCE_ID | digits only, e.g. 1234567                        | Stack name instead of numeric User ID
# GRAFANA_CLOUD_API_TOKEN         | starts glsa_ or glc_                                  | Trailing newline; never paste in chat
#
GRAFANA_CLOUD_REMOTE_WRITE_URL=https://prometheus-prod-XX-prod-us-central-0.grafana.net/api/prom/push
GRAFANA_CLOUD_METRICS_INSTANCE_ID=
GRAFANA_CLOUD_API_TOKEN=

PROMETHEUS_JOB_NAME=sport-test-automator
PROMETHEUS_INSTANCE=local

# CI: set the same three variables as secrets
#   GitHub Actions → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
#   CircleCI → Project Settings → Environment Variables
#
# remote_write errors:
#   HTTP 400 → protobuf encoding; npm install prometheus-remote-write
#   HTTP 401 → wrong credentials (check formats above)
#   HTTP 404 → URL must end /api/prom/push (not /api/v1/write)
#   fetch is not defined → Node < 18
#
# After first push: Explore → {__name__=~"sport_e2e_.*"} with time range Last 15 minutes

# BrowserStack Automate (Playwright cloud runs)
# Portal: https://automate.browserstack.com — Account → Settings for username/access key
# BROWSERSTACK_USERNAME=
# BROWSERSTACK_ACCESS_KEY=

# Email alerts on test failures (used by scripts/email-report.cjs and GitHub Actions)
# SMTP_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USERNAME=
# SMTP_PASSWORD=
# ALERT_EMAIL_TO=
# ALERT_EMAIL_FROM=
# Legacy local aliases also supported: SMTP_USER, RECIPIENTS

